    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math> retardation factor</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>travelled</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>by</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>the</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>substance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>from</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reference</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>line</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>cm</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>Distance</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>travelled</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>by</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>the</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solvent</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>from</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reference</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>line</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>cm</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Note: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math> value of different compounds are different.</p></blockquote>",
